flowchart TD
  A[User request] --> B[Classify task]
  B --> C[getSchemaMarkdown]
  C --> D[Inspect labels, properties, types and relationships]
  D --> E{Advanced query?}
  E -- Yes --> F[getSearchQuerySpec]
  E -- No --> G[Build query from discovered names]
  F --> G
  G --> H[findRecords / search]
  H --> I[Inspect evidence and validate result]
  I --> J[Explain answer with uncertainty]
  K[Business semantics and authorization] -. remain application responsibilities .-> J
